---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Privacy Policy — Sokéfi">
  <main>
    <section class="pillar-header-card" aria-labelledby="privacy-title">
      <div class="pillar-header-text">
        <p class="pillar-eyebrow">Sokéfi</p>
        <h1 class="pillar-title" id="privacy-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="pillar-tagline">Last updated: July 2026</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section pillar-intro" aria-label="Privacy policy content">
      <div class="pillar-intro-text">
        <p>
          Sokéfi (&quot;we,&quot; &quot;us,&quot; &quot;our&quot;) respects your privacy. This
          policy explains what information we collect, how we use it, and the choices you have.
        </p>

        <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Email address</strong>, if you subscribe to The Sokéfi Edit newsletter or
            otherwise sign up to hear from us.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Usage data</strong>, collected automatically when you visit the site (e.g.,
            pages viewed, browser type, general location, referring site) via standard analytics
            tools.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Cookies</strong>, used to support basic site functionality and, where
            applicable, analytics.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <p>
          We do not collect sensitive personal information (financial details, health information,
          government IDs) through this site.
        </p>

        <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>
            To send The Sokéfi Edit newsletter and related communications, if you've subscribed.
          </li>
          <li>To understand how visitors use the site, so we can improve content and design.</li>
          <li>To respond if you contact us directly.</li>
        </ul>

        <p>We do not sell your personal information.</p>

        <h2>Affiliate Links</h2>
        <p>
          Some pages on Sokéfi, particularly on our Resources page, may contain affiliate links. If
          you click one and make a purchase, we may earn a small commission at no additional cost to
          you. We only recommend products and services we genuinely believe in, consistent with our
          editorial standards.
        </p>

        <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>
          We may use third-party services (such as email delivery platforms, analytics providers, or
          hosting infrastructure) that process data on our behalf. These providers are bound by
          their own privacy practices.
        </p>

        <h2>Your Choices</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>You can unsubscribe from The Sokéfi Edit at any time via the link in any email.</li>
          <li>You can control cookies through your browser settings.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>If you're in the European Union or United Kingdom (GDPR)</h3>
        <p>You have the right to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Access</strong> the personal data we hold about you.</li>
          <li><strong>Correct</strong> inaccurate data.</li>
          <li><strong>Delete</strong> your data (&quot;right to be forgotten&quot;).</li>
          <li><strong>Restrict or object to</strong> certain processing of your data.</li>
          <li>
            <strong>Port</strong> your data to another provider in a structured, machine-readable format.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Withdraw consent</strong> at any time, where we rely on consent (e.g., newsletter
            subscription).
          </li>
        </ul>

        <p>
          Our legal basis for processing your data is your consent (for newsletter sign-up) and our
          legitimate interest in understanding site usage (for analytics). To exercise any of these
          rights, contact us at <a href="mailto:hello@sokefi.com">hello@sokefi.com</a>. You also
          have the right to lodge a complaint with your local data protection authority.
        </p>

        <h3>If you're a California resident (CCPA/CPRA)</h3>
        <p>You have the right to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Know</strong> what personal information we collect and how it's used.</li>
          <li>
            <strong>Delete</strong> personal information we've collected from you, subject to certain
            exceptions.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Opt out</strong> of the &quot;sale&quot; or &quot;sharing&quot; of personal information.
            Sokéfi does not sell personal information. Depending on the analytics and advertising tools
            we use, some data sharing with service providers may qualify as &quot;sharing&quot; under
            CCPA/CPRA — we'll disclose this here as our tooling is finalized.
          </li>
          <li><strong>Non-discrimination</strong> for exercising any of these rights.</li>
        </ul>

        <p>
          To exercise any of these rights, contact us at <a href="mailto:hello@sokefi.com"
            >hello@sokefi.com</a
          >. We will respond within the timeframe required by law.
        </p>

        <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p>
          Sokéfi is not directed at children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect information
          from children.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this policy from time to time. The &quot;Last updated&quot; date above will
          reflect the most recent revision.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions about this policy can be sent to <a href="mailto:hello@sokefi.com"
            >hello@sokefi.com</a
          >.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Base>
